("Writing Task 2 requires an essay of at least ___ words.","150|200|250|300",2,"250 words in 40 minutes.","Writing"),
("In Reading, a claim the passage never mentions is marked","False|Not Given|True|Contradictory",1,"'Not Given' means no information either way.","Reading"),
("Skimming a passage means","reading every word|moving fast for the general idea|reading aloud|copying text",1,"Skim for gist; scan for detail.","Reading strategies"),
("Scanning is best for","finding a specific name, date or figure|enjoying the style|improving pronunciation|memorising words",0,"Scanning hunts targeted details.","Reading strategies"),
("In Listening, numbers, dates and plurals commonly cost marks because candidates","write them carelessly|hear them too clearly|never hear them|have perfect spelling",0,"Small details are the classic trap.","Listening"),
("A map-labelling Listening task mainly tests","following directions in a description|essay writing|skimming|speaking speed",0,"You track locations as described.","Listening"),
("Speaking Part 2 gives you a cue card and ___ to speak.","30 seconds|1–2 minutes|5 minutes|10 minutes",1,"You talk 1–2 minutes on the topic.","Speaking"),
("Speaking Part 3 involves","a monologue you memorise|a two-way discussion of abstract issues|reading a passage|writing a summary",1,"Part 3 extends Part 2 into discussion.","Speaking"),
