("Memorised, rehearsed answers are penalised under","Fluency and Coherence|Task Achievement|Lexical Resource|nothing — they help",0,"Examiners detect memorisation.","Speaking criteria"),
("In True/False/Not Given, a claim CONTRADICTED by the passage is","True|False|Not Given|Half true",1,"Contradiction = False; silence = Not Given.","Reading"),
("General Training Reading differs from Academic mainly by using","harder science texts|everyday, workplace and general materials|no passages|only advertisements",1,"GT sources are practical.","Test format"),
("The Listening test plays each recording","twice|once only|three times|until you finish",1,"Each recording is played once only.","Listening"),
