("Spelling in Listening and Reading must be","perfectly correct|nearly correct|phonetic|optional",0,"Incorrect spelling loses the mark.","Listening"),
("In Academic Writing Task 1, you must NOT","describe trends|give a personal opinion on the data|compare categories|select key features",1,"Task 1 reports, never opines.","Writing"),
("A formal Task 2 essay avoids","clear paragraphs|contractions like don't and can't|linking words|a clear position",1,"Formal register bans contractions.","Writing"),
("The Task 2 introduction should","copy the prompt verbatim|paraphrase the question and state your position|tell a personal story|list synonyms",1,"Paraphrase plus position sets up the essay.","Writing"),
