("Reading passages get progressively","easier|harder|shorter|faster",1,"Passage 3 is typically the hardest.","Reading"),
("Matching headings mainly tests your grasp of","paragraph main ideas|exact sentences|grammar|spelling",0,"Headings summarise paragraphs.","Reading"),
("Summary completion requires words that fit both ___ and grammar, taken from the passage.","colour|meaning|length|accent",1,"Meaning plus grammatical fit from the text.","Reading"),
("The Reading test overall time is","20 minutes per passage at will|60 minutes total|30 minutes total|90 minutes",1,"60 minutes for three passages.","Test format"),
("Speaking is assessed on Fluency, Lexical Resource, Grammatical Range and","Volume|Pronunciation|Speed|Posture",1,"Pronunciation is the fourth criterion.","Speaking criteria"),
("Long silent pauses during Speaking mostly hurt","Fluency and Coherence|Vocabulary|Task Response|Handwriting",0,"Fluency penalises hesitation.","Speaking criteria"),
