("Idiomatic language raises your score when","memorised in lists|used accurately in context|translated literally|forced everywhere",1,"Accurate, natural idioms lift Lexical Resource.","Speaking criteria"),
("The Listening section has ___ parts.","2|3|4|5",2,"Four sections, forty items.","Test format"),
