("In the Writing band, Task 2 carries roughly ___ of the weight.","half|two thirds|one third|exactly equal",1,"Task 2 counts about twice Task 1.","Test format"),
("Which best paraphrases: 'The graph shows a sharp rise in car ownership'?","Cars went up very high lots.|The chart illustrates a steep increase in car ownership.|The graph is showing sharp rise cars.|Car ownership graph sharp rising.",1,"Academic verbs plus correct structure.","Writing"),
("Which is the best overview sentence for a line graph?","Then it went up and down.|Overall, the figures for both cities trended upward over the period.|In 2010 the line was at 20 and later 25 in 2012 and after that 30.|Firstly, secondly, thirdly.",1,"An overview states the main trend.","Writing"),
("Describing 20% as 'a fifth' shows","weak maths|good lexical range|a spelling error|band 4 behaviour",1,"Range of fraction forms is rewarded.","Writing"),
